# Client flow through the gateway, for the VS Code REST Client extension.
# Run the requests top to bottom against `make up && make seed`.
# The confirmation token is in the notification log:
#   docker compose -f deploy/compose/docker-compose.yml logs notification | grep email_confirmation

@api = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@email = me-1@example.com
@phone = +79001234567
@password = correct-horse-battery-7

### Register
POST {{api}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "{{email}}", "phone": "{{phone}}", "password": "{{password}}"}

### Confirm the email (token from the notification log)
@confirm_token = paste-token-here
POST {{api}}/auth/confirm-email
Content-Type: application/json

{"token": "{{confirm_token}}"}

### Log in
# @name login
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}"}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
@refresh_token = {{login.response.body.$.refresh_token}}

### Salons
# @name salons
GET {{api}}/salons

### Masters of the first salon
# @name masters
GET {{api}}/salons/{{salons.response.body.$.items[0].id}}/masters

### Master card: profile, services and the nearest free slots
# @name card
GET {{api}}/masters/{{masters.response.body.$.items[0].id}}/card

###
@master_id = {{masters.response.body.$.items[0].id}}
@service_id = {{card.response.body.$.master.services[0].service_id}}

### Free slots for a week ahead (adjust the dates)
# @name availability
GET {{api}}/availability?master_id={{master_id}}&service_id={{service_id}}&date_from=2026-11-02&date_to=2026-11-08
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Book the first free slot
# @name booking
POST {{api}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{"master_id": "{{master_id}}", "service_id": "{{service_id}}", "start_at": "{{availability.response.body.$.days[0].slots[0]}}"}

### My bookings
GET {{api}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Move the booking to the second free slot
POST {{api}}/bookings/{{booking.response.body.$.id}}/reschedule
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"start_at": "{{availability.response.body.$.days[0].slots[1]}}"}

### Cancel the booking
POST {{api}}/bookings/{{booking.response.body.$.id}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Refresh the token pair
POST {{api}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{"refresh_token": "{{refresh_token}}"}

### Log out
POST {{api}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{"refresh_token": "{{refresh_token}}"}
